WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Every channel. One brain.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.800
Voice, chat, email, WhatsApp and SMS all hit the same receptionist. Same answers, same slots, same memory.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
Switch channels. Don't repeat yourself.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
Shared conversation memory means the next message already knows what the last one said.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Books real slots. Flags what matters.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
It checks the live calendar before it promises anything, and sends emergencies to a human.
